The Stop hook runs the supervision host in the arm'\''s place, and everything above still holds with these additions:
1. Attended (no away record, including a quiet-mode record; see [Postures](../supervision-host.md#postures)): a headless supervision session takes the wakes the supervision branch may take and never wakes you for a routine outcome, so fewer wakes reach you; check wakes, decision wakes, and whatever it cannot take still reach you exactly as above.
